# Search hygiene for ripgrep (and friends): .gitignore covers what must not
# enter the repo; this file adds artifacts GIT has no reason to care about
# but a SEARCH has no reason to scan. Only machine blobs you would never
# grep belong here - keep it as tight as .gitignore's spirit.
node_modules/
docs/_site/
packs/local/
labs/crashledger.json
labs/run-meta.json
labs/hardening.md
*.tsbuildinfo
